# Web3Forms access key for the contact form.
# Get a free key in seconds (no account) at https://web3forms.com — enter the
# email address you want messages delivered to, and they email you the key.
#
# This key is public/client-safe (it is only tied to your destination email),
# so it is inlined into the static build. For the GitHub Pages deploy, add it as
# a repository Variable named WEB3FORMS_KEY (Settings → Secrets and variables →
# Actions → Variables). For local development, paste it into .env.local.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
